   "evidence": "The proof of `exists_isOpen_injOn_baseCoord` (`(extChartAt J b).injOn (hWsub hc).2 (hWsub hd).2 ...; (modelCoord F).injective hcd`) repeats the new `hinj` in `Liouville/Fibration.lean` line for line (`(extChartAt J (\u03c0 x)).injOn (hWsub hc).2 (hWsub hd).2 ...; e.injective hcd`). `ExtChartAt.lean` already holds `exists_contMDiffMap_eventuallyEq_extChartAt`, which both of them build on.",
