   "fix": "Move them as public lemmas next to `exists_contMDiffMap_eventuallyEq_extChartAt` in `TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/ContMDiffMap/ExtChartAt.lean`, or at least into `Liouville/Fibration.lean`. Then use them in both `nonempty_homeomorph_unitAddTorus` and `baseCoord_comp_spec`, deleting the inline copies.",
   "issue": "`baseChart`, `baseChart_eventuallyEq`, `modelCoord`, `baseCoord`, `contMDiff_baseCoord`, `mvfderiv_baseCoord_apply` and `exists_isOpen_injOn_baseCoord` are pure manifold facts: a smooth map into `Fin (finrank \u211d F) \u2192 \u211d` with the chart's germ at `b`, injective near `b`, with differential `modelCoord` at `b`. Nothing symplectic is used. They are `private` here, and `nonempty_homeomorph_unitAddTorus` in `Liouville/Fibration.lean` rebuilds the same objects inline (`\u03ba\u2080`, `e := ContinuousLinearEquiv.ofFinrankEq`, `hinj`). Making them `private` does not fix their placement.",
